hp-check[19916]: info: :Check types:                                                    
hp-check[19916]: info: :a. EXTERNALDEP - External Dependencies                          
hp-check[19916]: info: :b. GENERALDEP - General Dependencies (required both at compile  
hp-check[19916]: info: :and run time)                                                   
hp-check[19916]: info: :c. COMPILEDEP - Compile time Dependencies                       
hp-check[19916]: info: :d. [All are run-time checks]                                    
